              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid",
              "description": "Identifier of the accepted ResetPassword operation/intent after verified primary-contact OTP plus enrolled recovery code. Not a challenge ID, raw proof or secret. Exactly one of SessionReference and this field is permitted."
